# Slagstorm's 3 damage to each creature is one simultaneous event (CR 120.2) and Tomik's replacement applies to each recipient
# alone: Bot2's Fanatic of Rhonas (1/4) takes 3 + 1 = 4 and dies, though 3 would not kill it, while Bot1's own Fanatic of Rhonas
# (1/4) takes plain 3 and survives with 3 damage marked (4 would kill it). Bot1's Tomik (1/2) dies to the 3 damage (lethal either
# way). Tomik was on the battlefield when the damage was dealt, so he counts.

